    <briefdescription>
<para>A <ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_link_graph" kindref="compound">LinkGraph</ref> pass that splits blocks in a section that follows the DWARF <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_record" kindref="compound">Record</ref> format into sub-blocks where each header gets its own block. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When splitting EHFrames, <ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_d_w_a_r_f_record_section_splitter" kindref="compound">DWARFRecordSectionSplitter</ref> should not be run without <ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_e_h_frame_edge_fixer" kindref="compound">EHFrameEdgeFixer</ref>, which is responsible for adding FDE-to-CIE edges. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
